From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: suckbluefrog <suckbluefrog@proton.me>
Date: Fri, 10 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +000
Subject: [PATCH] stdafx: include stdint.h for public integer types

The installed stdafx.h header exposes typedefs based on uint8_t,
uint16_t, uint32_t and int64_t in the non-Windows branch. Those typedefs
must not depend on consumers defining libmodplug's private configure
macros such as HAVE_STDINT_H.

Include stdint.h in the non-Windows public-header path before the typedefs
that use those types.

Signed-off-by: suckbluefrog <suckbluefrog@proton.me>
---
 src/libmodplug/stdafx.h | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/src/libmodplug/stdafx.h b/src/libmodplug/stdafx.h
index 5ca4a18..e8e2764 100644
--- a/src/libmodplug/stdafx.h
+++ b/src/libmodplug/stdafx.h
@@ -66,6 +66,7 @@ inline void ProcessPlugins(int n) { (void)n; }
 
 #else
 
+#include <stdint.h>
 #include <stdlib.h>
 #include <stdio.h>
 #include <string.h>
-- 
2.50.0

